sume()`。通过条件是：沿用原 Run/Turn/Tool/result identity，每个 Tool 旧 Attempt 标为 `SUPERSEDED`、新增连续 Attempt，整批 Tool 先完成且只执行一次，然后才发下一次 Provider 请求。当前实现预计会在“只能恢复一个 paused Tool”处稳定失败。"},{"id":"tool-call-exec-fe3699e1-71a6-40c1-b952-66aa455620a9","kind":"toolCall","title":"Editing files","status":"completed","toolCallId":"exec-fe3699e1-71a6-40c1-b952-66aa455620a9","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":66178,"startedSeq":66177,"endedSeq":66178,"timestamp":"1788484660Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-rs_0fffa506fcf94449016a9a1c37db2487d0a1448cdaeebed924","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":66181,"startedSeq":66180,"endedSeq":66181,"timestamp":"1788484664Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"\n\n**Verifying necessary imports**"},{"id":"tool-call-exec-77975410-cf84-4ea0-84ae-8c8f595d2865","kind":"toolCall","title":"Get-Content ji-java/core/ji-agent-core/src/test/java/io/github/diodeme/ji/agent/core/AgentRuntimeContractTest.java -TotalCount 45; .\\gradlew.bat :ji-agent-core:test --tests io.github.diodeme.ji.agent.core.AgentRuntimeContractTest.restartResumeExecutesTheWholeDurableToolBatchBeforeCallingProvider --offline","status":"failed","toolCallId":"exec-77975410-cf84-4ea0-84ae-8c8f595d2865","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":66499,"startedSeq":66182,"endedSeq":66499,"timestamp":"1788484667Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-rs_0fffa506fcf94449016a9a1c4078d487d0b4b6c3b35a343985","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"01a0698d-c4d0-7861-993a-91f9cd7f10e5","seq":66502,"startedSeq":66501,"endedSeq":66502,"timestamp":"1788484673Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":fal